                                   "title":  "A Bride for Rip Van Winkle (2016) - Metacritic reviews - IMDb",
                                   "snippet":  "The three-hour runtime seems justified when Iwai lets his characters fragile, burgeoning relationships develop at a leisurely pace and revel in the little details. At other times the pic is simply self-indulgent, allowing scenes to slip from emotionally naked to embarrassingly overwrought in a flash. Iwai served as his own editor and it shows.",
                                   "link":  "www.imdb.com/title/tt4671274/criticreviews/"
